<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:02:32Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>推崇⽑澤東的「Z世代」：彈幕、「教員」與政治失語</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c33k4zjm6lro/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T01:05:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c33k4zjm6lro/trad--c9c022a0a41f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c33k4zjm6lro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從2019年開始，《毛澤東選集》突然躍居清華大學圖書館年度借閱榜榜首，此後一直到2025年都穩居榜首。網絡上，不少年輕人稱毛澤東為「教員」，並追捧他的影視形象。為何這位已故領導人重新受到關注？</summary></entry><entry><title>董建華逝世：從船王富二代到香港首任特首，中共的「親密朋友」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T09:29:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad--7c9b72110192.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國全國政協前副主席，香港首任特首董建華逝世，享年89歲。他的前半生見證主權移交前香港的東方之珠年代，後半生更走入最高行政當局左右香港的前途。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:02:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T09:32:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平與貝安德首次通話 基調積極 同時提及黎智英</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1j4n836le2o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:02:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T09:08:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1j4n836le2o/trad--f9473b1711bf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1j4n836le2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">通稿還引述貝安德表示，「願將雙邊關係恢復到歷史最高水平」，更好造福兩國人民。然而，唐寧街10號發佈的通話紀要中，並未出現「恢復到歷史最高水平」的措辭。</summary></entry><entry><title>關稅真正會讓加拿大人和美國人付出什麼代價</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrj0l2ydyo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:02:26Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T08:30:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrj0l2ydyo/trad--2e791a1170b6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrj0l2ydyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一年多來，家庭和企業早已習慣關稅對生活成本帶來影響，如今又將有哪些變化？</summary></entry><entry><title>尼泊爾給水力發電押下重注，泥石流把問題徹底暴露</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0re1x8wg24o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T05:19:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0re1x8wg24o/trad--7b373c005b9c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0re1x8wg24o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一場喜馬拉雅山冰岩崩造成的泥石流，摧毀了尼泊爾超過10%的發電能力。</summary></entry><entry><title>尼泊爾—西藏泥石流：堰塞湖和冰湖是下一個「定時炸彈」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T00:01:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad--418da5ad44fa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">事發河谷上游已形成兩個堰塞湖。與此同時，原本散佈在喜馬拉雅山區的冰川湖，在災區內有10座被標記為高風險，專家形容它們是「定時炸彈」。</summary></entry><entry><title>泥石流摧毀西藏吉隆口岸的關鍵幾分鐘</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T12:01:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad--6512b63ed4b6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">吉隆口岸位處西藏與尼泊爾的重要貿易通路之上，中國與尼泊爾兩側各有數以百計外國旅客在泥石流衝擊後下落不明。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國審查西藏口岸遭洪災衝擊畫面，當地災民情況我們所知甚少</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T12:37:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad--5ba777fb8c53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些關於這場致命山洪暴發最驚人的畫面，中國官方媒體未對公眾播放。</summary></entry><entry><title>英國制裁約旦河西岸：對以色列關係跌至數十年谷底</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804dd0de8no/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:02:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T12:15:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804dd0de8no/trad--864d5e000df9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804dd0de8no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">以色列針對倫敦禁止與被佔領約旦河西岸以色列定居點進行貿易所作出的反應，凸顯了這一刻的重要性。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我一度認不出我的男朋友」：我是如何發現自己患有臉盲症的</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr4vwye0z02o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T01:05:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr4vwye0z02o/trad--c097ff774a14.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr4vwye0z02o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在被診斷出患有相貌失認症（prosopagnosia），也就是臉盲症後，BBC記者卡羅琳・斯蒂爾探討了這種狀況背後的科學，包括它的成因，以及專家如何判斷一個人是否患有此症。</summary></entry><entry><title>美軍航母全數撤離印太：台灣該擔心「空窗期」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:35:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad--6657e14d6610.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家稱，航母給美國盟友的是心理保證。印太區域沒有航母，「會加強一種整體感覺：美國正被中東局勢分心。」</summary></entry><entry><title>朝俄首座跨境公路橋通車 烏克蘭團體擔心加快軍援物流</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c36ljn4e8k1o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T13:37:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c36ljn4e8k1o/trad--ed3145ba1b7f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c36ljn4e8k1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">自俄羅斯入侵烏克蘭以來，莫斯科與平壤的關係明顯加強。</summary></entry><entry><title>定罪戰犯「波斯尼亞屠夫」姆拉迪奇去世 塞爾維亞數千人送殯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ym2zy4r77o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T03:26:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ym2zy4r77o/trad--a04e54745a55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ym2zy4r77o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">姆拉迪奇因在 20 世紀 90 年代波斯尼亞戰爭期間犯下種族滅絕罪而被監禁，歐盟警告塞爾維亞不要美化這名被定罪的戰爭罪犯。</summary></entry><entry><title>哈利和梅根重返英國 國王發函重申兩人已非「在職王室成員」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3v4d0kpg3zo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T02:44:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3v4d0kpg3zo/trad--bd87787d06ff.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3v4d0kpg3zo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">王室消息人士表示，這封信函已寄送給哈里王子的團隊、政府、軍方及全國各地郡尉。</summary></entry><entry><title>歐洲國家為何提走北美黃金儲備</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzv9w5w6yo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T00:03:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzv9w5w6yo/trad--51e0539ebe2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzv9w5w6yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">荷蘭已將86噸閃閃發亮的黃金儲備從美國遷移至其他地方，究竟發生了甚麼事？</summary></entry><entry><title>印尼火山爆發：機場延長關閉，逾34萬旅客滯留</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyj8n145weo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T16:37:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyj8n145weo/trad--ca052ec035d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyj8n145weo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印尼喀拉喀托之子火山（Anak Krakatau）爆發，多個機場連續第二天停運，數以十萬計旅客滯留。該局警告火山「未來一段時間再次爆發的可能性仍然很高」。</summary></entry><entry><title>「教員萬歲」：中國Z世代為何重新「擁抱」毛澤東？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2z9pgprrdo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:02:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T07:57:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2z9pgprrdo/trad--606ec44f7095.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2z9pgprrdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析認為，面對就業壓力和貧富差距，一些中國年輕人重新從毛澤東的階級論述尋找答案；毛時代強調的「獨立自主、自力更生」，在今日中西方競爭的背景下，也再次產生吸引力。</summary></entry><entry><title>董建華：從「船王」之子到香港首任行政長官</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2n75en5g6o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T18:50:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2n75en5g6o/trad--339b978fd8c1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2n75en5g6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國香港特區首任行政長官董建華逝世，享年89歲。「香港好，國家好」是他特首生涯中最為人熟知的一句說話。</summary></entry><entry><title>韓國光州雙年展: 中國退展，「台灣館」風波透露什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zd7j8nn0o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:56:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zd7j8nn0o/trad--3c74b05b6dc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zd7j8nn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">韓國舉行的光州雙年展因「台灣館」名稱遭改動陷入爭議，中國週四（9月3日）宣布退出展覽。</summary></entry><entry><title>前線報導：BBC深入尼泊爾隧道和被洪水吞沒的小鎮</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy4z8w39j3no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:25:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy4z8w39j3no/trad--de1fa82ba0ca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy4z8w39j3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在貝特拉瓦蒂地區，一些居民返回面目全非的家園，他們還要面臨的一大挑戰是如何處理逝者的遺體。與此同時，救援人員仍未放棄尋找倖存者，他們相信仍有人受困於特里蘇里河沿岸的隧道內。</summary></entry><entry><title>重獲自由未有期 回顧黃之鋒的公共生涯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T13:55:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad--7214d6bbc403.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控違反《香港國安法》下的「串謀勾結外國勢力」罪，2026年9月2日在高等法院出庭並認罪，法官將案件押後判刑。</summary></entry><entry><title>霍爾木茲海峽動盪，如何在巴拿馬運河引發中美角力？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T13:39:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad--77ccfd7692d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國再次就巴拿馬運河問題交鋒。這條戰略水道約佔全球海運貿易量5%，而美國近40%的集裝箱運輸都經過這裏。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國稱數十國助中國避特朗普關稅</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T05:11:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad--ca9553d15fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國一份新報告稱，中國透過關稅較低的國家轉運貨物，以規避較高關稅。</summary></entry><entry><title>特習會後美中再現摩擦　「建設性穩定」能否撐到九月？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-04T00:01:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad--6863f100f319.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">關稅、台灣、安全議題再起摩擦，特習會後的美中「建設性穩定」還能持續多久？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄的太空攻防戰：衛星如何成為現代戰爭的第一擊？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-01T09:56:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad--77d395c5dbdc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在現代戰爭中，環繞地球運行的人造衛星幾乎未曾受到波及；但到了21世紀，太空或許已不再是安全的避風港。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普政府禁止中國人形機械人進口 北京批「泛化國家安全」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-07-29T11:14:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad--e9e1ec045b93.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國正陷入一場爭奪全球機械人與人工智能領導地位的競賽。</summary></entry><entry><title>機器人開始索要小費，但錢到底進了誰的口袋？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn5dx6gqxn9o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T02:02:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn5dx6gqxn9o/trad--97a95326a9aa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn5dx6gqxn9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">自疫情以來，人們被索要小費的場合比以往任何時候都多，而且往往是由數字支付系統主動提示的。消費者抱怨這是一種「情感勒索」，而建議小費的百分比還在不斷攀升。儘管有些人嘲笑美國人「失控」的小費文化，但它正蔓延全球。</summary></entry><entry><title>《肖申克的救贖》中國公映：官方字幕翻譯何以引發爭議？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd4361y6no/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T00:24:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd4361y6no/trad--96ebef9f3bbd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd4361y6no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">例如，同性戀（homosexual）譯成「不同的人」，queer 譯成「變態」，「make love under tree」（直譯應為「在樹下做愛」）譯成「許下終身」。</summary></entry><entry><title>印度洋蔥「政治敏感」得要坐上鐵路快車</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j2kp0818o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T13:17:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j2kp0818o/trad--db19d8b41252.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j2kp0818o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印度洋蔥價格急劇飆升，這種家家戶戶必備食材正被運往主要城市。這個國家生產和消費大量洋蔥，而其價格波動歷來具有政治影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>行走在紐約：我發現監控攝像頭數量遠超想像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyznp4qlg9o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T06:25:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyznp4qlg9o/trad--f8ee58d5303d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyznp4qlg9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在私隱與安全之間作出取捨時，了解你所在社區的監控基礎設施到底有多普遍或會有所幫助。要查清楚這一點已有一些簡單的方法。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃之鋒：從學運領袖到國安法囚犯，重獲自由未有期</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T14:11:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad--afefb304de53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">自2020年11月被關押以來，香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控多宗罪名，至今已身在獄中接近六年。</summary></entry><entry><title>氣候變暖如何影響你的飛行旅程？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3057m5q127o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T06:39:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3057m5q127o/trad--ac4acdc18d55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3057m5q127o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著氣候變遷的影響日益加劇，人們是否將不得不接受越來越多的延誤和改道？</summary></entry><entry><title>「究竟是誰在批准什麼？」：光州雙年展台灣改名風波背後的角力</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c2kwv977qlko/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T14:33:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c2kwv977qlko/trad--f5a9fa958415.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c2kwv977qlko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">8月初，韓國舉行的光州雙年展因主辦單位改動「台灣館」名稱陷入爭議。事件曝光後，台灣參展藝術家提出抗議，當地許多藝術家、民眾也進行聲援。主辦單位最終同意恢復使用「台灣館」，但引起中方不滿。</summary></entry><entry><title>從特朗普到中國，德國極右翼政黨州選獲勝意義在哪？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cddvzm721vpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T14:36:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cddvzm721vpo/trad--f479675c8cbb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cddvzm721vpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC歐洲事務編輯卡緹雅·阿德勒認為，極右翼在薩克森—安哈特州獲勝，為歐盟及傳統政黨敲響了警鐘。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普取態何以左右福克蘭群島爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q6pyyzn0o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T07:42:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q6pyyzn0o/trad--f86cba00f091.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q6pyyzn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著阿根廷總統米萊承諾為福克蘭群島帶來「變革之風」，特朗普會改變他對英國統治的立場嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>中國科技公司新嘗試：「性愛」機器人，瞄準「陪伴經濟」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T08:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad--7169231e3977.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年來，中國的「陪伴經濟」異軍突起，AI和機器人技術的高速發展亦給這個市場注入諸多新的可能。</summary></entry><entry><title>不同版本的世界地圖有哪些正確及錯誤之處？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T04:35:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad--ab1df95ad712.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">聯合國決計採用新的世界地圖來反映非洲的真實面積。但讓我們仔細看看不同版本的世界地圖有哪些正確和錯誤之處。</summary></entry><entry><title>偏頭痛女性比男性慘痛太多 這裏舒緩有方</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz9zk1vx53vo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T00:17:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz9zk1vx53vo/trad--9e4dfad06cef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz9zk1vx53vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">荷爾蒙、睡眠不足和壓力，都能解釋為何女性更容易受到這種令人衰弱的神經系統疾病所困擾。</summary></entry><entry><title>豬腎在人體內運作271天——這會是器官移植的未來嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1dlr007vkgo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T05:57:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1dlr007vkgo/trad--21f8b5056ce3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1dlr007vkgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一名男子在等待人體腎臟移植期間，依靠移植的豬腎存活了創紀錄的九個月。</summary></entry><entry><title>執迷於「睡眠分數」如何反讓你睡得更差？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3wj1gd3x9no/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T02:05:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3wj1gd3x9no/trad--cb717d4dcba9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3wj1gd3x9no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">不少人會配戴追蹤器，檢測自己的睡眠分數，並用盡方法「睡眠極大化」（sleepmaxxing）。但專家指出，把睡眠遊戲化，正導致更多人出現睡眠失調問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國NASA全新超強望遠鏡將改寫我們對宇宙的理解</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-09T13:01:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:34:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad--d1936a91f9c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅曼太空望遠鏡（Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope）8月30日從佛羅里達州肯尼迪太空中心發射升空。</summary></entry></feed>
